'''Infinity 0 — Interview''' is [[The_Storyized_Interviewer]]'s intake interview log for the
''Infinity 0'' input: which output types are needed, and the requirements for each. See
[[Infinity_0]] for the raw input status itself — this page is the *instructions* half of the input wiki
(''SPEC.md'''s "things and instructions"), kept separate since the interview may be revisited later.

== Output types requested ==

* '''LaTeX''' — publisher-ready print PDF. Full print-ready typesetting: trim size, margins, running
  heads, ready to send to a printer. Specific trim size and print house style not yet pinned down.
* '''Webpage''' — rich multimedia, linear. Linear story, no branching/choice paths, enhanced with
  images, audio, and animation per scene.
* '''3D model''' — scene/environment models. Covers places/settings from the book, not characters.

== Status ==

* '''Interview state:''' first pass complete — output types and top-level goals captured. Per-type
