* '''Webpage:''' hosting/platform, whether audio needs original composition or licensed/generated audio,
  image style/generation approach.
* '''3D model:''' file format (glTF, OBJ, engine-native), which scenes take priority, level of detail.
* '''General:''' does each output type track an order the same way the input is deliberately unordered
